      "writtenOn": "2021-08-23T04:11:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this has made things worse than before. Once the connection is made, VS or microdroid_manager shouldn\u0027t be involved for the communication between apps.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 173,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 174,
