      "message": "Rather than using is_none() and unwrap(), it\u0027s more idiomatic to do something like:\n\n```\nif let Some(vm) \u003d self.state.lock().unwrap().get_vm(cid) {\n    info!(\"VM having CID {} started payload\", cid);\n    vm.callbacks.notify_payload_started(cid);\n    Ok(())\n} else {\n    error!(...);\n    Err(new_binder_exception(...))\n}\n```\n\nOr alternatively:\n\n```\nlet vm \u003d self.state.lock().unwrap().get_vm(cid).ok_or_else(|| {\n    error!(...);\n    new_binder_exception(...)\n})?;\n\ninfo!(...);\nvm.callbacks.notify_payload_started(cid);\nOk(())\n```",
